+  if any((p+n)&0x7fffff in forced or any((p>>16)in(b,b^128)and lo<=((p+n)&65535)<hi for b,lo,hi in data)for n in range(i.length)):raise ValueError('child masked source')
+  if getattr(i,'const_z_fold_unconditional',False):raise ValueError('child inherited flag branch')
+  if i.mnem=='JSL':
+   if i.operand!=0xff03 or (k.m,k.x)!=(1,1) or len(k.p_stack)!=1:raise ValueError('unproven child suspended edge')
+   cases.append({'callsite':p,'landing':p+4,'p_mask':48,'p_value':48})
+  elif i.mnem in ('JSR','RTS','RTI','XCE','TCS','TXS','MVN','MVP'):raise ValueError('child ownership barrier')
